WEBVTT

00:05:57.352 --> 00:06:01.186
As a result, if you are very, very smart

00:06:01.186 --> 00:06:02.981
and very, very lucky,

00:06:02.981 --> 00:06:05.832
you can get very, very rich

00:06:05.832 --> 00:06:08.362
very, very quickly.

00:06:08.362 --> 00:06:11.204
The latest poster boy for this phenomenon

00:06:11.204 --> 00:06:13.184
is David Karp.

00:06:13.184 --> 00:06:16.039
The 26-year-old founder of Tumblr

00:06:16.039 --> 00:06:18.821
recently sold his company to Yahoo

00:06:18.821 --> 00:06:21.854
for 1.1 billion dollars.

00:06:21.854 --> 00:06:23.392
Think about that for a minute:

00:06:23.392 --> 00:06:27.806
1.1 billion dollars, 26 years old.

00:06:27.806 --> 00:06:31.253
It's easiest to see how the technology revolution